<div class="rounded-box bg-base-200 p-8 md:p-10 lg:col-span-8" role="status">
  <p class="label text-base-content/75">{% if record.kind == "signed" %}A signed copy, kept for you{% elsif record.kind == "order" %}Ordered tonight{% else %}Off the shelf{% endif %}</p>
  <p class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.75rem] leading-snug font-medium">Thank you, {{ record.name }}. {% if record.kind == "hold" %}We'll put {{ record.title }}{% if record.author %} by {{ record.author }}{% endif %} behind the counter today{% else %}We'll look for {{ record.title }}{% if record.author %} by {{ record.author }}{% endif %}{% endif %} and {% if record.contact == "text" %}text{% else %}call{% endif %} you at the number you gave as soon as it's {% if record.kind == "hold" %}ready{% else %}here{% endif %}.</p>
  <p class="body-copy mt-3">{% if record.mail %}We'll call first to take payment, then mail it. {% else %}It waits for you for ten days, and you pay when you pick it up. {% endif %}Questions? Call (401) 555-0163.</p>
</div>
